SUMMARY:Planting Roots and Planning Ahead: Estate Essentials for New Canadians - Abraham Somavarapha
DESCRIPTION:As a new Canadian\, estate planning might feel complicated—especially if you still have family\, responsibilities\, or property in another country. Join us for this free webinar hosted by Abraham Somavarapha and our partners at Advisors with Purpose created specifically for immigrants to Canada. We’ll help you understand the essentials so you can confidently plan your legacy and take care of what matters most. You’ll learn: \n\nWhat makes a Canadian will legally valid\nWhat documents you need and when to update them\nHow to handle foreign property and cross-border issues\nWays to support family members living abroad\nWhat estate planning typically costs in Canada\n\n      Link to register: https://calendly.com/awpwebinar/april-29-2026
URL:https://knox.utoronto.ca/event/planting-roots-and-planning-ahead-estate-essentials-for-new-canadians-abraham-somavarapha/
END:VEVENT
